                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Lokman, S., Bal, R., Didden, R., & Embregts, P. J. (2024). Factors affecting the feelings of safety among individuals with mild intellectual disabilities and severe challenging behaviour in residential care: A qualitative study of professional and service users' perspectives. Journal of intellectual disabilities. Advance online publication."
                },
                "publicationIDType": {
                  "typeName": "publicationIDType",
                  "multiple": false,
